Section 7 — Regulatory / Standards Acknowledgments
The applicant acknowledges that this application is filed under, and the proposed facility will be designed,
constructed, and operated in conformance with:
• Alleniom DER Interconnection Standard DIS-01 Rev 4 (effective 03/01/2024).
Alleniom Utilities · DER Program Office PXA-2025-0198 | DIS-APP-01 | Page 2

• Telemetry & Communications Standard TCS-02 §5 (utility-owned RTU + SCADA telemetry required at
≥500 kW; no permission-to-operate without live telemetry).
• Distribution Protection Standard DPS-07 Rev 2, as applied by Alleniom to the site protection scheme.
• Alleniom's currently published Certified Equipment List (CEL-2025-Q2, effective 04/30/2025).
• APUC-filed interconnection tariff §12.
The applicant further acknowledges that post-execution changes to nameplate capacity or point of
interconnection require withdrawal and reapplication per DIS-01 §7.
Section 8 — Applicant Certification and Signature
The undersigned, on behalf of the City of Elmsworth, certifies that the information provided in this
application and its attachments is true and complete to the best of the applicant's knowledge, that the
applicant has authority to file this application for the identified site, and that the applicant will comply with
the Alleniom DER interconnection standards and the APUC-filed tariff §12 governing this facility.
